      "message": "Please add a link to the upstream discussion (https://lore.kernel.org/all/1648713656-24254-1-git-send-email-zhaoyang.huang@unisoc.com/) in your description.\n\nThe upstream (me included) is not convinced that this is the right direction, so please work there to either persuade them or change the approach so that it\u0027s acceptable.",
